'''Secret Crush Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] added in [[Version 11.3 Update|Version 11.3]] that can be obtained from the [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat Catcademy]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 650
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Secret Crush Cat
|name2 = Girlfriend Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Girlfriend Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This unit is a fairly strong damage dealer against short-ranged Traitless enemies like [[Duche]] or [[Dagshund]]. If protected by enough meatshields, a small stack of Secret Crush Cats can quite easily deal with any Traitless threat that gets outranged, even the [[Manic Lion Cat (Enemy)|Manic Lion Cats]] in [[Lots O' Lion (Deadly)|Lots O' Lion]], to a degree. Problems come when longer-ranged foes risk ending up in the frontline, as Secret Crush Cat dies quite easily and isn't very spammable, nor can she quickly land a hit before being pushed back.

[[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] easily surpasses her in most aspects outside of range, making her obsolete once [[Flow Like the Stream (Merciless)|Bottom of the Swamp]] is cleared, with a few rare exceptions for enemies like [[Otta-smack-u]]. Even then, once [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]] is obtained, he also ends up outclassing her for the few enemies she can counter.

{{Job|Classification = Melee}}

