==Trivia==
*Appearance-wise, Secret Crush Cat is essentially a catified version of [[wikia:tokimemo:Shiori Fujisaki|Shiori Fujisaki]] from the dating sim series ''Tokimeki Memorial'', except that her uniform is a darker shade of blue and has a red tie. All the qualities mentioned in her Normal Form's English and Japanese descriptions also match Shiori, and ''Tokimeki'' means [[Heartbeat Catcademy (Event Gacha)|Heartbeat]] in Japanese.
*Secret Crush Cat's Japanese name contains a pun. ''Nyanko'' (a childish way of saying "cat") would normally be spelled using only hiragana (にゃんこ), but Secret Crush Cat spells it as にゃん子, with 子 (''ko'') being a common suffix in feminine names.

